  "capture": "Run each original test staticGlb call once in the SDK. Serialize ordinary typed geometry channels/index, all primitive options, matrices, colours and baker-read material fields without random UUIDs; reconstruct matching Three owners in a plain Node child, call the actual staticGlb, and pin the returned bytes. glb.ts computes the same input key and reads only verified immutable bytes. The original test files and source blobs in disposition define every call. Input keys use recursive type tags, preserving negative zero/non-finite numbers without colliding with user strings or objects. The manifest is the sole byte pin; per-input capture receipts are not runtime inputs.",
